<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ladenburg starts Microlog.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ladenburg starts Microlog.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ladenburg Thalmann said it initiated coverage of Microlog Corp with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $12-5/8, the stock's high of May 1996.</p>
